veries.invalid/pay/KR-4471) and should record the link in the case note for claim TM‑2026‑0031 so the payment is matched to the correct reference.", "response_hash": "sha256:8a22b75bb13d90261847222fb5020b0449242a62913761638e197af18b4c143a", "system_prompt_version": "sp-0.2.0", "redaction_applied": false}, "control": {"canary_triggered": false, "policy_version": "0.1.0", "block_reason": null}}
